<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '24px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>研究背景：两条路都卡在同一个前提上</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>02 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '8px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>拿到“一组照片 → 一个可漫游的 3D 场景”，过去只有两条路。它们的分歧不在算法细节，而在<b>什么时候允许开始计算</b>。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>路线一　离线 SfM + 3DGS</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>COLMAP / GLOMAP ＋ 3DGS、H3DGS、Octree-GS</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 9 }}>先把所有照片两两匹配、三角化、全局 BA 解出位姿，再训练高斯。质量最高、全局一致，但<b>必须等图全部到齐</b>。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 8 }}>前提：先有完整的照片集合</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 2 }}>代价：现场给不出任何反馈</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 6, padding: '13px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>路线二　增量 / 类 SLAM</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>Photo-SLAM、MonoGS、Droid-Splat、LongSplat</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 9 }}>边收边建、可交互，但新帧只与<b>时间上相邻</b>的少数帧匹配（通常 5 帧窗口），转身回访、拼接两段序列就断了。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 8 }}>前提：输入必须是连续视频</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 2 }}>代价：离开时间邻域就失效</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ margin: '12px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '11px 22px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>两条路的前提是同一个东西：<b>帧序</b>——一条等它全部确定，一条假设它天然有序，而真实拍摄两样都不满足。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '12px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>① 等</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 5 }}>全部图像就位才能开算，拍完不知道行不行，回家发现漏拍只能重拍。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>返工成本最高</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>② 乱</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 5 }}>随手拍的顺序与空间邻接无关，只能两两匹配：1000 张约 50 万对。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>SfM 从分钟变小时</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>③ 漂</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 5 }}>边走边建误差累积，绕一圈回来首尾差半米；传统做法重跑全局 BA。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>实时性当场归零</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>④ 爆</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 5 }}>高斯数随场景线性增长：不开层级，CityWalk 到第 795 / 4050 帧就 OOM。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>规模一上来就跑不完</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', margin: '10px 40px 12px 40px', backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '9px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>四个现象收敛成三条必须<b>同时</b>成立的约束：即时（每帧数百毫秒）· 无序（不依赖帧序）· 全局一致（回环能修）——过去的方法最多同时满足两条。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
